                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Customer Complaint Handling Procedure\n4. Handling times\nTable 1 gives the handling times that apply to each category. Business days exclude weekends and Bank holidays and are counted from the day after the complaint is logged.\n**Table 1. Complaint categories and service levels**\nFees and charges, **Examples** = Overdraft fee, monthly service fee, wire fee. Fees and charges, **Acknowledge within** = 2 business days. Fees and charges, **Resolve within** = 10 business days. Fees and charges, **Owner** = Customer Care. Deposit accounts, **Examples** = Holds on deposits, account closure, statement errors. Deposit accounts, **Acknowledge within** = 2 business days. Deposit accounts, **Resolve within** = 15 business days. Deposit accounts, **Owner** = Customer Care. Card disputes and unauthorized transactions, **Examples** = Debit or credit card charges the customer did not make. Card disputes and unauthorized transactions, **Acknowledge within** = 2 business days. Card disputes and unauthorized transactions, **Resolve within** = 10 business days to investigate or provisionally credit, final decision within 45 days. Card disputes and unauthorized transactions, **Owner** = Card Services. Lending and loan servicing, **Examples** = Payment application, modification denials, collections conduct. Lending and loan servicing, **Acknowledge within** = 2 business days. Lending and loan servicing, **Resolve within** = 15 business days. Lending and loan servicing, **Owner** = Loan Servicing. F",
