                "title": "complaint_handling_procedure.docx",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Customer Complaint Handling Procedure\n9. Reporting and records\nCustomer Care reports volume, categories, handling times and root causes monthly to the Compliance Committee. Every quarter the report goes to the Credit Risk Committee with the complaints that concern lending, collections and card disputes. A complaint record, including all letters and call notes, is kept for 5 years after the case closes.",
