                "title": "complaint_handling_procedure.docx",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Customer Complaint Handling Procedure\n3. How complaints arrive\nCustomers may complain at any branch, by telephone through Customer Care, through secure messaging in online banking, by letter or by email to the Customer Care mailbox. Whoever receives the complaint is responsible for logging it in the complaint system on the day it arrives, with the customer's identifier, the account or loan involved, the category in Table 1 and the date received. A complaint received by a branch is never forwarded without being logged first.",
