                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Customer Complaint Handling Procedure\n1. Purpose and scope\nThis procedure sets out how Harborview Community Bank receives, records, investigates and resolves complaints from retail customers about deposit accounts, credit cards, loans, fees, branch service, online banking and card disputes. It applies to every employee. Treating complaints promptly and fairly is a regulatory expectation and is also how the Bank finds and fixes problems before they affect other customers.",
